## Interface: 16001
## Title: GaarMailForever
## Notes: Mailbox helpers for WoW Forever: an Open All button on the inbox (money and items, never COD, optional delete of empty system mail), a recipient dropdown of recent names and your alts, Alt-click in your bags to attach items to a letter (Ctrl+Alt for up to 12 stacks of the same item), and a new-mail notice in chat. Each feature can be switched off. /gmail
